{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "损失往哪走",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 95.75,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "六大类里，钱到底丢在哪儿？我们看损失的变化。",
   "spoken": "六大类里，钱到底丢在哪儿？我们看损失的变化。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 6.171
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "先说口径。下面的数字来自公开报道和安全公司的年度统计，按事发时的美元估值，都是约数。",
   "spoken": "先说口径。下面的数字来自公开报道和安全公司的年度统计，按事发时的美元估值，都是约数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 7.244,
   "dur": 8.928,
   "speechStart": 7.342,
   "speechEnd": 15.327
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "2016 年，The DAO 因为重入，损失约 6000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2016 年，The-DAO 因为虫入，损失约 6000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 16.392,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 16.49,
   "speechEnd": 20.502
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "那几年多是重入、溢出这类代码漏洞。编译器和库成熟以后，这类漏洞少了。",
   "spoken": "那几年多是虫入、溢出这类代码漏洞。编译器和库成熟以后，这类漏洞少了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 21.556,
   "dur": 7.368,
   "speechStart": 21.654,
   "speechEnd": 28.092
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "2022 年，Ronin 跨链桥损失约 6.2 亿美元，原因是验证者私钥。",
   "spoken": "2022 年，Ronin 跨链桥损失约 6.2 亿美元，原因是验证者私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 29.144,
   "dur": 6.432,
   "speechStart": 29.242,
   "speechEnd": 34.73
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "2024 年，DMM Bitcoin 损失约 3.05 亿美元。入口是假招聘，落点是供应商的终端。",
   "spoken": "2024 年，DMM-Bitcoin 损失约 3.05 亿美元。入口是假招聘，落点是公应商的终端。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 35.796,
   "dur": 8.52,
   "speechStart": 35.894,
   "speechEnd": 43.475
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "2025 年，就是开头的 Bybit，约 15 亿美元，出在前端和签名界面。",
   "spoken": "2025 年，就是开头的 Bybit，约 15 亿美元，出在前端和签名界面。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 44.536,
   "dur": 6.552,
   "speechStart": 44.634,
   "speechEnd": 50.241
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "2026 年 10 月，Binance 热钱包损失约 63.4 亿美元。这是项目方的口径。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 10 月，Binance 热钱包损失约 63.4 亿美元。这是项目方的口径。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 51.308,
   "dur": 7.224,
   "speechStart": 51.406,
   "speechEnd": 57.689
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "按这个口径，它超过此前任何单起事故的 4 倍。",
   "spoken": "按这个口径，它超过此前任何单起事故的 4 倍。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 58.752,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 58.85,
   "speechEnd": 62.504
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "趋势很清楚。最大的损失，从代码漏洞，转向了跨链桥和运营安全。",
   "spoken": "趋势很清楚。最大的损失，从代码漏洞，转向了跨链桥和运营安全。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 63.532,
   "dur": 7.152,
   "speechStart": 63.63,
   "speechEnd": 69.842
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "私钥、多签、前端、社工、内部人。代码审计，覆盖不到这些环节。",
   "spoken": "私钥、多签、前端、社工、内部人。代码审计，覆盖不到这些环节。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 70.904,
   "dur": 7.296,
   "speechStart": 71.002,
   "speechEnd": 77.368
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "但数学类漏洞并没有消失。2025 年的 Balancer V2，在舍入方向上出了错。",
   "spoken": "但数学类漏洞并没有消失。2025 年的 Balancer-V2，在舍入方向上出了错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep01/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 78.42,
   "dur": 7.488,
   "speechStart": 78.518,
   "speechEnd": 85.075
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "项目方口径约 9480 万美元，早期报道约 1.28 亿。成熟的协议，也会在这里出错。",
